OL,3,ARainmakers: The drones used to seed
OL,4,Aclouds
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 23 August, Cooper Freeman had no
OL,7,Fidea clouds above his head were being
OL,8,Ffilled with a silver compound in order
OL,9,Fto cause rainfall.
OL,11,FNeither did thousands of other
OL,12,Fresidents in Homer, Alaska, who later
OL,13,Fdiscovered San Francisco start-up
OL,14,FRainmaker conducted an experiment in
OL,15,Fthat region using cloud-seeding
OL,16,Ftechnology.
OL,18,FThe company claims it produced 19
OL,19,Fmillion US gallons of water in the sky
OL,20,Fin three hours.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,110,105,200,160,0,100
